category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libbz2-devel
sdesc: "Efficient n-gram & skipgram modelling on text corpora (utilities)"
ldesc: "Colibri Core is software to quickly and efficiently count and extract patterns
from large corpus data, to extract various statistics on the extracted
patterns, and to compute relations between the extracted patterns."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/proycon/colibri-core
